{"id": "official:sentence:4143fafe-e8f2-4600-a588-542a815806bd", "text": "他表现的像个疯子。", "shortMeaning": "他做事像个疯人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ba7fc82-8996-43a7-a098-ede463351534", "text": "他被一件辛苦的工作累坏了。", "shortMeaning": "一件苦差事把他累垮了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7c1dd54-dbf7-428b-8553-d3b81cba3deb", "text": "他被他的邻居们愚弄了。", "shortMeaning": "邻居们把他戏耍了一番。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc487b86-fd3e-4076-affb-887198213047", "text": "他被任命为驻美日本大使。", "shortMeaning": "他被派去做日本驻美大使。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9cdaf3b5-f4cb-4d7e-8c92-200faf107b16", "text": "他被卷进了是非中。", "shortMeaning": "他被搅进一场纠纷里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73c09083-c12f-4589-a868-27583aa10b70", "text": "他被困在教室里了。", "shortMeaning": "他被关在教室里出不来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6968ed5c-dfb6-4bbb-8fcf-f2c5f10dfc1b", "text": "他被奖励了一块金表。", "shortMeaning": "他得了块金表作奖励。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31a696da-d52f-479e-a37a-a1c84f00c450", "text": "他被她的笑容吸引住了。", "shortMeaning": "她的笑把他迷住了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:afff1310-5cab-414f-b804-ee49bbe13854", "text": "他被她的美貌迷倒了。", "shortMeaning": "她的模样把他迷倒了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17fbd069-17dc-43c5-82d0-b7877ef9f24c", "text": "他被揭露是她的父亲。", "shortMeaning": "真相揭开，他原来是她的父亲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:488c1bbe-7556-4b83-91d7-f539de08f3dd", "text": "他被活生生地埋葬。", "shortMeaning": "他被人活埋了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:363d7a0d-9d9e-49ab-9da0-9ac3195fe52e", "text": "他被认为是这座城市里最好的律师。", "shortMeaning": "人都说这城里最好的律师是他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6053d6fe-c507-46c8-8b15-ead06260e17c", "text": "他被那个女人吸引住了。", "shortMeaning": "他让那个女人吸引住了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:122ba666-a3b1-4bdf-9fb7-28f72c7192d3", "text": "他装作什么都知道的样子。", "shortMeaning": "他装得像什么都懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:33d983b2-03d2-427e-bd32-4e5c0a640d8f", "text": "他要去图书馆占位。", "shortMeaning": "他要去图书馆占座。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b70ab3b-89c1-4744-a884-51fa8b407c3d", "text": "他要我立刻还钱给他。", "shortMeaning": "他要我马上把钱还他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d24220f2-59e5-4624-8bc0-08e4cf40258a", "text": "他要把这些红酒带到中国送礼。", "shortMeaning": "他要带这些红酒到中国去送礼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:088d660f-1618-4da0-a6ba-d37e5e3efdc4", "text": "他要是不知道这个，就不会来了。", "shortMeaning": "他若不知道这事，就不会来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:754f61fd-01fb-4533-ab98-8f026ea97c94", "text": "他要是成了，我跟你姓。", "shortMeaning": "他要是办成了，我随你姓。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15d4450f-1438-40cf-8453-d62732b5d4a3", "text": "他要求我们服从规则。", "shortMeaning": "他要我们照规矩来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8323c21-944e-4a69-bea3-6c14c969239b", "text": "他要求我保存秘密。", "shortMeaning": "他让我把这事守住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dc9b5d15-a6ae-43fd-8520-029d21943eb1", "text": "他要求我马上付钱。", "shortMeaning": "他催我立刻付钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16966823-1981-44ed-9768-77fcb83ddacf", "text": "他要负责任，但这责任他可担当不了。", "shortMeaning": "责任该他负，他却担不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a0399f0-55f9-4d1f-b3d4-5d7dc3f8e147", "text": "他要跟她一起去沙滩。", "shortMeaning": "他要跟她一道去沙滩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bae61aec-2c4b-4441-986a-5c072ff8f19c", "text": "他观察入微，但沉默寡言。", "shortMeaning": "他看得细，话却少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95198af6-558d-4a45-82a3-9aba1975b99a", "text": "他觉得他很重要，但其实并不是。", "shortMeaning": "他自以为要紧，其实不然。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d199dcc-0590-45b5-a70f-e8a7a75ba435", "text": "他觉得必须报道这件事。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得这事非报不可。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4e92a0b-6010-4a78-95fa-ac910132af38", "text": "他觉得我理所应当知道答案。", "shortMeaning": "他认为答案我该知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:afe7876f-37e7-4c79-b629-f609673ef783", "text": "他觉得最终遇到了一个和他旗鼓相当的对手。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得总算碰上对手了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2da8c5e-8d21-434b-96fb-14cd2cd527df", "text": "他觉得自己占了上风，但我反过来扭转了局面。", "shortMeaning": "他以为占了上风，我却把局面翻了过来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39c4bcc3-df6a-43dd-b060-a0a2ec0ad24d", "text": "他解释了句子的字面意思。", "shortMeaning": "他把句子的字面讲了讲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6dafd6dd-36f8-497f-8c3f-6023594636c0", "text": "他解释了这个计划的主要目标。", "shortMeaning": "他说了这方案的主旨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:600949ec-97b9-4c9c-a4cc-53922c8ea532", "text": "他解释事故是怎么发生的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲了事故是怎么出的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:950f46bd-87f1-44e6-b1e5-7a5186774d2e", "text": "他认为他不需要他们的保护。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得自己不用他们护着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67d46046-2a0f-497c-a83c-ee0a22800550", "text": "他认为只有训练有素的演员才能够获得成功。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得只有受过训练的演员才成得了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4110e3c0-36c1-4336-99da-7a30059ebfad", "text": "他认为太极拳改善了他的生活。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得太极让他日子好过些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db3c10cf-302c-409e-a0fd-a6da570e6b44", "text": "他认为我们当中有一个奸细。", "shortMeaning": "他以为我们里有个内应。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4df7376c-3143-4524-a6b8-5efa0d4cd5a1", "text": "他认为我非常的累。", "shortMeaning": "他以为我累得很。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:054857e5-78b8-46fe-861e-4ede94bf7c4e", "text": "他认为财富和幸福是等同的。", "shortMeaning": "他把有钱和快活当成一回事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af3f3cd4-0c15-45b8-aabe-b464b3d977ee", "text": "他认为这可能是个陷阱。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得这可能是个圈套。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd477333-9cc3-4eba-becd-d87b23132e9f", "text": "他让人们摆脱了奴役。", "shortMeaning": "他让众人脱了奴役。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:335f840a-10b6-465a-aedc-386d3b6bd195", "text": "他让我气得头疼了。", "shortMeaning": "他把我气得头疼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b61ec67f-1932-4ae3-a823-e6c0aa305aaa", "text": "他让我等了一个多小时。", "shortMeaning": "他叫我等了一个多钟头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6bace7f-470e-4310-b749-5c236ebce586", "text": "他让所有窗户都开着。", "shortMeaning": "他让窗户全敞着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:037be65e-ed92-4ed0-a9c7-991d35e83c4f", "text": "他让秘书用打字机写信。", "shortMeaning": "他叫秘书用打字机打信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d96f7065-344c-47e8-b286-0e3251fd190f", "text": "他讲了一个有趣的故事。", "shortMeaning": "他讲了个好听的故事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c89f374e-72c8-4b81-a042-299a346d048c", "text": "他讲的笑话很有意思。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的笑话很逗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b088f9c4-4e86-43d6-8da7-389022fc02a2", "text": "他讲起那场事故，讲得仿佛他亲眼所见。", "shortMeaning": "他说起那场事故，像亲眼见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1276b53-5da9-4593-bc5b-9190c1315623", "text": "他试图扩大自己的势力范围。", "shortMeaning": "他想把自己的地盘铺大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d09715f-d8ec-4ee4-95d6-8e1c62270429", "text": "他试图把注意力集中在信上。", "shortMeaning": "他想把心思放在那封信上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82c59ac8-6c8e-49c9-98ef-13daff0c2584", "text": "他试图游过河，但是失败了。", "shortMeaning": "他想游过河，没成功。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47dc8a51-9a32-4770-83fb-b8279472df36", "text": "他试图表现得很愉快，但我们都知道他有多悲伤。", "shortMeaning": "他装得快活，我们都知道他心里多苦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:baa0b9d8-d8f2-42e0-87ac-c849f4c17a5f", "text": "他试图转移大家的注意力。", "shortMeaning": "他想把大家的注意引开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2626fe28-1fd4-427f-827a-b3c439be5979", "text": "他试着跟我们说法语。", "shortMeaning": "他试着用法语跟我们讲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41e0864a-4ed2-4158-b005-68928c2c28c6", "text": "他试过写一本短篇小说。", "shortMeaning": "他试着写过一篇短篇小说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e20db031-34a8-4316-bdcd-2f31df63685c", "text": "他详细地解释了他看到的事。", "shortMeaning": "他把看到的事细细讲了一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34d43b63-7e8f-496e-8cce-54beef140e4c", "text": "他误认为我是一个英国人。", "shortMeaning": "他把我错当成英国人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f010ead-0a22-4a4e-98ef-16ea26344118", "text": "他说世界语是一门像日语，又像拉丁语的语言。", "shortMeaning": "他说世界语像日语，又像拉丁语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f53760b1-3b41-4f99-8147-9b6f52cf2808", "text": "他说他不希望她亲自做。", "shortMeaning": "他说不希望她亲自去做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e94f75e-503f-4b41-ba60-295a630ddd29", "text": "他说他前一天就认识她了。", "shortMeaning": "他说前一天就认得她了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5c37b660-f75d-48d8-98ef-7b14f36ad2a0", "text": "他说他是不幸运的。", "shortMeaning": "他说自己运气不好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eac38dca-bf19-4b72-93c5-072bb6681f52", "text": "他说他是在非洲出生的。", "shortMeaning": "他说自己生在非洲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee071963-475d-4cd1-be5e-5c08d7a7f0e8", "text": "他说他每天早上六点起床。", "shortMeaning": "他说他每天清早六点起身。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1385f2a4-a728-4aaf-a76e-e9fe36479e07", "text": "他说他没有做过那件事。", "shortMeaning": "他说那事他没干过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4450b5bc-fe18-42b9-9a93-26d053e6aa25", "text": "他说他没有进房间，那是骗人的。", "shortMeaning": "他说没进房间，那是假话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ace6af4f-eaea-4ea8-ab6d-be7e9817a3fa", "text": "他说他父亲是建筑师，他也想跟他一样。", "shortMeaning": "他说父亲是建筑师，他也想干这行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3253101-aa7b-42ae-85e8-bf8999f40536", "text": "他说他知道这个秘密。", "shortMeaning": "他说这秘密他知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:134bb82c-32ec-403c-aa8c-1248060b04c6", "text": "他说他让你说慢一点。", "shortMeaning": "他说让你讲慢些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7410ad94-3e57-4d80-8e4d-019e2133965e", "text": "他说地就像之前度过这本书一样。", "shortMeaning": "他讲得好像从前读过这本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebde5fb6-7437-4567-be44-ecaf8404e252", "text": "他说如果他知道她的地址，他会写信给她。", "shortMeaning": "他说要是知道她地址，就给她写信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8aadd8d4-45e8-4c79-8291-30f4a7d5162c", "text": "他说完就站起来走了。", "shortMeaning": "他话说完，起身就走。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b30ba3e-4ece-489c-b0dc-f7d509753eea", "text": "他说得好像他什么都知道。", "shortMeaning": "他说得像样样都懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b1030f04-51a2-4fc4-877c-6c27511c0044", "text": "他说得好像知道这个秘密一样。", "shortMeaning": "他讲得像是知道这桩秘密。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4db70d64-c98d-4805-988a-54028e89ab56", "text": "他说得就好像他真的在国外读过书一样。", "shortMeaning": "他讲得像真在外国念过书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:104ba6f1-5df8-4346-bf0b-7b3a0b87e7dd", "text": "他说戴维斯必须被抓住。", "shortMeaning": "他说戴维斯非抓住不可。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39c6563b-2128-4ff5-bc6c-d3dee25b78ad", "text": "他说服了他老婆不离婚。", "shortMeaning": "他劝住了老婆，没离婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:928cb024-09b6-43b1-84b1-66d9ed426cc9", "text": "他说永远都不亲她。", "shortMeaning": "他说永远不亲她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35e7dbe4-197a-497f-8c03-f23e4cee62f0", "text": "他说法语说得很流利。", "shortMeaning": "他法语讲得流利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e320bcb-7c5f-44be-a8dc-1b9f634da54e", "text": "他说用完这本书后会借给我。", "shortMeaning": "他说这本书用完了借我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb09d9ca-c695-4d19-9bc4-bcbe5661c8be", "text": "他说的不可能是真的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的断不会是真的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:199c7000-88b8-4e11-ac94-97d3173464be", "text": "他说的总体上是正确的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的大体没错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12e7de91-f172-496c-892c-685ee1b370e9", "text": "他说的我还是没有全部理解。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的我还是没全懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:be28de3d-de8d-4114-a06f-c8ed51d6f8bd", "text": "他说的时候，我脑中浮现出了画面。", "shortMeaning": "他说时，我脑子里现出画面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e280e5da-7ffe-4b58-9dfe-6ac1979bfbbf", "text": "他说的没有一句实话。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的没一句真话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9ae8fcd-c494-4896-bbce-74ed65387322", "text": "他说的话不合情理。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的话不合情理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6c27870-a44a-4c22-9e2b-4fafee25bdca", "text": "他说的话了，你明不明白？", "shortMeaning": "他讲的意思你明白没有？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5560fdc0-cd3f-4c64-a4e5-42acd4acafcb", "text": "他说的话全不可信。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的话一句也不能信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fdd8285-385d-44e8-9d92-fd30e5a9f71e", "text": "他说的话我没注意。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的话我没留神。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1c9aba0-3088-46d6-b04c-4122f249fd78", "text": "他说的话根本毫无意义。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的话全无意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e4b1b0b-ce65-482b-a0eb-f00c7c552eed", "text": "他说的话没一句是真的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的没一句作真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7869d84f-8d95-4e83-a52c-e3627c526d76", "text": "他说英语有德国口音。", "shortMeaning": "他英语带着德国腔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a2b0e7e-40d5-4bc6-ad0f-4ad31c37b6f6", "text": "他说英语流利得就好像他是美国人。", "shortMeaning": "他英语顺得像美国人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:128c8ee3-712d-4149-ad08-6c2b1d34bcf8", "text": "他说英语，法语还是德语？", "shortMeaning": "他讲的是英语、法语还是德语？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f0dc4bc-7a7f-4893-9f59-fd9b1711ce1a", "text": "他说话的样子好像知道你所有的事情。", "shortMeaning": "他说话的架势像知道你所有底细。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:744b8ec6-daf3-4f30-a042-ad8a0a46c081", "text": "他说过他不会进来，但他最后还是进来了。", "shortMeaning": "他说不进来，末了还是进来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88dc2728-11ca-42a3-a334-2952092d931f", "text": "他请求她给予优待。", "shortMeaning": "他求她给个方便。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b43b652b-64ff-4e15-9bb5-68ed3f3dad8f", "text": "他责备了我的疏忽。", "shortMeaning": "他怪我不上心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b33a7836-55e4-47ec-bebf-10257c666062", "text": "他费了不少劲，爬上了那棵树。", "shortMeaning": "他费了好大力气爬上那棵树。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2d86ab7-c289-47a2-b4f2-0dc0921d46ac", "text": "他赚的比我多三倍。", "shortMeaning": "他的进项有我三倍多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84bf74a0-e0cf-4d14-8f6d-e78f00aa3073", "text": "他赚的薪水是我的两倍。", "shortMeaning": "他挣的那份钱顶我两个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0bea0e1f-d1cb-4b6a-b16b-ac512562a613", "text": "他赚的钱比我多三倍。", "shortMeaning": "他进项顶我三倍还多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d15bc8a6-2201-43e0-a0ed-d98e8e6ce5d4", "text": "他赢了竞赛而获得了奖品。", "shortMeaning": "他在比赛里赢了，得了奖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee3c8d08-e5a8-4972-b2e6-081bca26bc73", "text": "他走后，我们都很想念他。", "shortMeaning": "他一走，我们都很想他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69efc970-0ae8-43fd-bbed-aeda76e8ffc9", "text": "他走路或者骑车过来。", "shortMeaning": "他或走或骑车过来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c999645-ec09-486c-8469-7f397aeca7ba", "text": "他跑得太快，停下来时气吁吁的。", "shortMeaning": "他跑得太急，一停就直喘。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82c7cca1-b94e-4b03-a73a-1819b7d8baa1", "text": "他跑得能有多快就有多快。", "shortMeaning": "他撒开腿尽量快跑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd80863e-d1b9-49a6-bc55-18183e9d0a1a", "text": "他跟他们干脆地断绝来往了。", "shortMeaning": "他跟他们一刀两断了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4551cdf-36c7-45f6-8d6d-49783d39bea4", "text": "他跟你说什么，你就做什么。", "shortMeaning": "他让你做什么，你就做什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:307d6305-a545-4061-8eab-7126ca55c944", "text": "他跟你轻轻说了什么？", "shortMeaning": "他跟你小声说了句什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17ecaed1-a7f8-43f9-8c74-b4725224b416", "text": "他跟她没啥共同点。", "shortMeaning": "他跟她说不到一块儿去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a107ec1-04d8-469d-a7ea-d76bd4da8f53", "text": "他跟她说这样的话真是太残忍了。", "shortMeaning": "他对她说这种话，太狠了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24a1aa9b-63dc-4f6d-8650-b5de315eba2f", "text": "他跟平时一样把钥匙放在书桌上。", "shortMeaning": "他照旧把钥匙搁在书桌上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c999b9b-3231-4cc6-bb47-3e3d61b2b2b5", "text": "他跟您年纪差不多。", "shortMeaning": "他岁数跟您差不多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01204208-c59b-476b-879e-cd3536d984f3", "text": "他跟我不住在一个小区。", "shortMeaning": "我们俩不住一个小区。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2c644f5-70f3-4ff3-88e7-87a038250ff5", "text": "他跟我们不是一伙的。", "shortMeaning": "他跟我们不是一路人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb30f542-00b6-40cd-b3dd-6b81f6125e62", "text": "他跟我们待到了这个月的月初。", "shortMeaning": "他在我们这儿待到本月初。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13410101-60cc-4544-8e64-3da4b7e744ba", "text": "他跟我想的不一样。", "shortMeaning": "他想的跟我不一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d4ff65d6-5f60-429d-bd0b-744147c857a9", "text": "他跟我解释了怎么用那台机器。", "shortMeaning": "他教我那台机器怎么使。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0839362-af8e-4e9a-bb8b-334a24016c8b", "text": "他跟我讲了他的人生故事。", "shortMeaning": "他跟我讲了他这辈子的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7be0fb5b-ebae-465b-815d-8c399061b3c1", "text": "他跟我说了他明天从北京机场飞往英格兰。", "shortMeaning": "他说他明天从北京机场飞英格兰。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:576e146f-ade9-46b4-ac7c-e325976ee524", "text": "他跟我说我很苍白，并问我怎么了。", "shortMeaning": "他说我脸色发白，问我怎么了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b93aff56-d27d-4d93-a84a-4f7d9a1610b9", "text": "他跟着入室抢劫者。", "shortMeaning": "他跟着闯空门的贼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fcc1fb73-a039-4725-a6e0-762225a5c33d", "text": "他轻轻地推了我一下。", "shortMeaning": "他轻轻推了我一把。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13c92433-df3d-4c4b-8a55-88243f9cc5df", "text": "他辞了职，并参了军。", "shortMeaning": "他辞了差事，去当了兵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70b824bc-4725-4a98-9dbc-469ef1cfb806", "text": "他辞职后逃离了这个国家。", "shortMeaning": "他辞了职就出了国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1352834b-50d3-449b-9618-37de9e57c09f", "text": "他迅速瞥了一眼杂志。", "shortMeaning": "他飞快地扫了一眼杂志。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4a48133-7eef-4cf1-874f-ad2d3b6447a4", "text": "他过来请我去帮那个他。", "shortMeaning": "他过来请我去帮他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c0b2494-4892-4567-a7ff-296b23e606c9", "text": "他过着（只够）勉强糊口的生活。", "shortMeaning": "他过日子只够糊口。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b275e585-6ce0-418a-b90a-42b404a19ab2", "text": "他迈着稳健的步伐登上了山丘。", "shortMeaning": "他稳步走上小山。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cce86626-9b88-43a4-8c0d-a9ecff3e8b2d", "text": "他还在这里附近的某个地方。", "shortMeaning": "他还在这一带的什么地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b062bbff-2ab0-4385-ac91-68ce12c2cccf", "text": "他还是个孩子，犯不上跟他生气。", "shortMeaning": "他还是个孩子，别跟他计较。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7094880d-2790-4cb5-9575-22fadbdd78a9", "text": "他还是赶快闭嘴的好。", "shortMeaning": "他还是快点住嘴为好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3792d7c8-fca9-4e71-81cf-0a0c8133a53f", "text": "他还没有傻到相信这个故事的地步。", "shortMeaning": "他还没傻到信这套话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a38b3e4-e8e4-48ee-8b57-eadb49667dec", "text": "他还没有去过法国，他很想明年去。", "shortMeaning": "他没去过法国，很想明年去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e5f382a-ddcb-48cf-8e2e-689eaea99403", "text": "他还没有恢复意识。", "shortMeaning": "他还没醒过来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ce88c4e-b121-4e57-a03a-c7c06b3ec0fc", "text": "他还没有把情况了解清楚就急忙发表意见。", "shortMeaning": "他情况没弄清就急着开口。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cd9d8e7-891e-4a8c-91b9-585e4ce84ca0", "text": "他还没有来，是不是？", "shortMeaning": "他还没到，对吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:655fce6a-287a-4848-a111-4e4fb333c96f", "text": "他还没有给我我借给他的钱。", "shortMeaning": "我借给他的钱他还没还。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ae90016-5667-49fb-9ebd-e79fc88e3b70", "text": "他这个人一无是处。", "shortMeaning": "他这人没一样长处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce67091e-6b5b-44ca-9f69-2d92fd98b800", "text": "他这个人心眼不好。", "shortMeaning": "他这人心术不正。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f3a224f-3aa7-489e-b5cc-f713c23adb95", "text": "他这个人话不多，但总是遵守诺言。", "shortMeaning": "他话少，可答应的事总算数。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e451fc0f-5075-4f40-9873-c9c59cd2022f", "text": "他这个时候该到了。", "shortMeaning": "这个点儿他该到了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74503ee7-4e35-4450-ab68-4d871142b3e4", "text": "他这么做，没有任何不安。", "shortMeaning": "他这样做，一点也不觉得不安。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37ff1dac-e717-4210-964b-cc27dc37ce1a", "text": "他这么说就是为了开玩笑。", "shortMeaning": "他这么说只是逗乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f196af3b-2749-41db-85d2-9369ef874c97", "text": "他这春天开始玩高尔夫球。", "shortMeaning": "今年春天他开始打高尔夫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23d12e47-c4c7-4c61-9f24-989ba06dcaea", "text": "他这样已经不是第一次了。", "shortMeaning": "他这样不止一回了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58f2b8ba-a146-4283-a03f-3f482f362583", "text": "他这样粗鲁，该棒打几下。", "shortMeaning": "他这么粗鲁，该挨几棍子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:013fee01-3aa2-41c9-8f4b-f819819be8fe", "text": "他进入了我的房间。", "shortMeaning": "他走进了我的屋子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e30f5f51-8934-476d-a6b2-3dea0304f1a0", "text": "他进来了，眼里闪着光。", "shortMeaning": "他进门来，眼里发亮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e0bb68c-7aca-4a11-b526-6c8e5d9d7820", "text": "他进来的同时，铃响了。", "shortMeaning": "他进门时铃也响了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b9b87728-4d00-475a-b893-043f57201af1", "text": "他连一声道歉也没有对她说。", "shortMeaning": "他连句抱歉都没跟她说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3746b9d-f9ef-480c-a087-1600fa79fd51", "text": "他连字都不会念，更别说写了。", "shortMeaning": "他连字都不认，更别提写了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:18530c77-b3de-4846-8b6b-1a2ce8875e80", "text": "他迟早会知道这个秘密的。", "shortMeaning": "这秘密他早晚会知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba2e3b41-011d-4bdb-9474-04abe9ed735c", "text": "他迫不及待地想要知道结果。", "shortMeaning": "他急着想知道结果。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f429850b-9ef3-4f90-9d45-c812f259698b", "text": "他迫不及待地想试一下他的新冲浪板。", "shortMeaning": "他急着要试试新冲浪板。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7d7110c-f063-4d69-9ef3-1079eee3b8ec", "text": "他送了她一束附带精美贺卡的花。", "shortMeaning": "他送她一束花，还配了张好看的贺卡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc7d3aa8-675c-4735-b770-4dbbe45b2666", "text": "他适应了新的生活。", "shortMeaning": "他惯了新的日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30756c2b-8447-4961-9c21-8c4900eeb0bd", "text": "他适应了新的生活方式。", "shortMeaning": "他惯了这种新的过法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d81e64a-c194-46a3-b015-590b9b0077d1", "text": "他逃了阿尔及利亚。", "shortMeaning": "他从阿尔及利亚跑了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73d6249e-f654-4c67-b564-3c6355305591", "text": "他选择不出席总统大选。", "shortMeaning": "他决定不去总统选举。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0d1c15d-c96f-414e-8e9f-a5d764ac3f1c", "text": "他选择了律师作为他的终生职业。", "shortMeaning": "他挑律师做一辈子的行当。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68be5a9a-5449-441f-80d3-934233c9a431", "text": "他选每个词都深思熟虑。", "shortMeaning": "他每个字都挑得很仔细。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:beacc916-9434-4475-aec7-bd4adb11e02e", "text": "他透露了我的秘密。", "shortMeaning": "他把我的私事说漏了出去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:977ff872-66d6-4a88-b8ed-1d74f2d0f690", "text": "他通过努力挣了大笔钱。", "shortMeaning": "他靠肯干挣了大钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:233442a7-403a-4e92-a5d1-8de774e5cf77", "text": "他通过告诉敌人我们所处的位置出卖了我们。", "shortMeaning": "他把我们的位置告诉了敌人，卖了伙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:539d4373-cea4-4fc8-a979-7d74b6eb609e", "text": "他通过巴黎去了伦敦。", "shortMeaning": "他从巴黎转去了伦敦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97e5ba02-6040-4987-8609-8d389631de15", "text": "他遇到了一个优秀的年轻人。", "shortMeaning": "他碰上一位很不错的年轻人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c49addba-8293-4f00-8f5d-75251f425e55", "text": "他遇到了事故，并伤了腿。", "shortMeaning": "他出了事故，腿受了伤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22ed385f-6217-40ab-a5d1-77cc9fb917b2", "text": "他遇到了交通事故。", "shortMeaning": "他碰上撞车了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b869d07-fbd5-4ded-bcb2-ded4ff506519", "text": "他邀请我去一个宴会。", "shortMeaning": "他请我去赴一场宴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ba4397a-e4c5-4052-acc7-2898f730438f", "text": "他那个样子啊，别提了！", "shortMeaning": "他那副样子，简直没法说！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ba09cdf-bff0-47ae-ad0c-5b8338c731bd", "text": "他那么诚实以至于大家都信任他。", "shortMeaning": "他实在，所以大家都信他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2802b36f-f12e-4ca8-898d-bdcc0c0084cb", "text": "他那时没有住在法国。", "shortMeaning": "他当时不住在法国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a3cda266-0887-4813-b41b-34dec4145792", "text": "他鄙视那个小伙子。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧不起那小伙子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ee383e8-5b1f-4b45-8e9a-e2aae5aa70de", "text": "他醉得忘了把门关上。", "shortMeaning": "他醉得忘了关门。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf0d3b3b-bf1e-4b99-8e00-ae27044c098b", "text": "他醉的时候，她总是哭。", "shortMeaning": "他一喝醉，她就哭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0f4a4aa-6a34-4098-984f-c37c005c82ef", "text": "他重新戴上了眼镜。", "shortMeaning": "他又把眼镜戴上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7e3ed24-9ab0-4a5b-a6ab-1a0be1e44781", "text": "他钢琴弹得非常好。", "shortMeaning": "他钢琴弹得很出色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d1ab5f2-c9a0-40d3-b4d8-19bcca2b2e87", "text": "他错过了7点30分的车。", "shortMeaning": "他误了七点半那班车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3425f6a4-38bd-461d-ae23-3f97a53c938c", "text": "他问我知不知道她的电话号码。", "shortMeaning": "他问我有没有她的电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ea34c5f-053f-4879-a683-56c4e1b2cf19", "text": "他问我，是不是知道她的电话号码。", "shortMeaning": "他问我是否晓得她的电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61e0cfe7-3c6b-42bb-b52a-a31106a9de2a", "text": "他间隔了很久才作答。", "shortMeaning": "他停了许久才答话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e7ede67-0d10-4082-ad55-4f503910fb53", "text": "他随意地把东西丢在抽屉里。", "shortMeaning": "他随手把东西扔进抽屉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b64c416b-105c-4bb9-bc9c-bc79e5450dbf", "text": "他雇佣了位女佣人。", "shortMeaning": "他雇了个女佣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:370e0650-dd9c-4c1c-964d-38f919bfe996", "text": "他需要和她亲自谈谈。", "shortMeaning": "他得亲自跟她谈一谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8eeead16-7d15-4917-8b14-cd90983363aa", "text": "他非常喜欢他的学校。", "shortMeaning": "他很喜欢自己的学校。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee1de5fa-c3b4-48a0-ae99-72173482ece5", "text": "他非常害羞。他说想见你们。", "shortMeaning": "他脸皮薄，说想见你们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d421b41a-136c-43ef-b935-4784abea60ea", "text": "他非常想要一辆自行车。", "shortMeaning": "他极想有辆自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:572ecc3b-1101-456b-9b23-9f49b0f92513", "text": "他非常想让别人满意。", "shortMeaning": "他很想让旁人称心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00329d59-1217-41bf-ad32-f7a60b90d3f2", "text": "他非常诚实，所以我们可以依赖他。", "shortMeaning": "他极实诚，我们可以靠他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5774993-a9b1-4446-8987-ddffa2921ed6", "text": "他靠什么维持生活？", "shortMeaning": "他靠什么过活？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30e37f45-5d1e-4b38-b853-9780962ccd1a", "text": "他顶着一张苦瓜脸。", "shortMeaning": "他脸上摆着一副苦相。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcd0be9b-9936-4b87-b3e3-6847ceac2532", "text": "他骑车从桥上过去。", "shortMeaning": "他骑车过了桥。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d6bd3a7-b265-46a0-ade3-d45edc317616", "text": "他高尔夫球打得好。", "shortMeaning": "他高尔夫打得不错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c358dd3a-5857-4902-9496-273ad03a63d3", "text": "他（仍然）在固执己见。", "shortMeaning": "他还是那样，认死理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:931462d7-8024-4571-b33d-0492eb35c07f", "text": "仙人掌既代表一种沙漠植物。", "shortMeaning": "仙人掌是一种沙漠里长的植物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6dc123c4-8c92-4adb-a5ad-f281cc9d9e2f", "text": "仙台地震的结果很恐怖。", "shortMeaning": "仙台地震的后果很惨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb83b7fc-24d9-45c1-83ef-311dbfd21ddf", "text": "代孕在中国是违法的吗？", "shortMeaning": "在中国，找人代孕犯法吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84a0b09a-a1b9-4352-85a1-12b73663ca61", "text": "代我向你们全家问好。", "shortMeaning": "替我向你全家问好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ddbb1cd-2dcf-4108-9672-3b4e4115685a", "text": "代我向祖国致以问候！", "shortMeaning": "替我向祖国问声好！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
